        "id": 53970,
        "name": "Vyolynce",
        "username": "Vyolynce",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/{size}/2397_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-29T21:46:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Putts\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/c5a1d2/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Putts:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was really looking to playing Sentinels over the next couple of weekends, and I was hoping to have the complete experience when doing so.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Out of curiosity… what were you missing? My shipment lacked only the oversized cards and tokens, neither of which are in any way essential to \"the complete experience\". I find it hard to believe that anything that could have been overlooked would affect this unless you planned on having insane marathon sessions with no repeats.</p>",
        "post_number": 271,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:28:17.466Z",
