      {
        "id": 53971,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T21:34:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@Putts</p><p>We use padded envelopes + protective cardstock to send out replacement cards on a regular basis, and pre-pay shipping rather than using stamps (so that they don't have to run through the machince). As a result, we have had very good luck with USPS for replacement cards, and they are generally delivered within 3 days in the continental US.</p><p>95% of the replacement cards from the Kickstarter were sent this morning; more recently reported issues will have their cards sent out tomorrow or Wednesday. We are also not happy about the delay in sending out these cards, and believe me, if it were physically possible to have sent them out sooner, we would have done so.</p>",
