        "id": 53973,
        "name": "XChylde",
        "username": "XChylde",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xchylde/{size}/2559_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-02T03:17:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, let us not forget that the product still came 2 months ahead of schedule. Any waiting you may be doing is still earlier than planned. In fact I say this as a guy also waiting for a forgotten item from my original shipment.&nbsp;</p>",
