        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/c5a1d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-05T17:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Vyolynce\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/48/2397_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Vyolynce:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Kickstarter corrections received yesterday! Thanks again!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Mail just got delivered, still no sign of mine as of today <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EDIT: Phew, finally got everything on Saturday in good shape. &nbsp;Just in time for the Sentinels game night I have planned for tonight <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
